    "categories": ["讚美主", "敬拜父", "聖經"],
    "key": "C大調",
    "time": "4/4",
    "hasChorus": false,
    "urls": {
      "hymnal": "https://www.hymnal.net/en/hymn/ts/12",
      "luke54": []
    },
    "notes": [
      {
        "type": "excerpt",
        "text": "你們當向聖所舉手，稱頌耶和華！願造天地的耶和華，從錫安賜福給你。",
